Classification of results
-------------------------
Exact:
- shifted Hamiltonian identity;
- Bogoliubov frequency;
- algebraic ladder matrix elements and polynomial identities;
- complete transformation formula W -> Psi.

Formal but independently verified:
- fixed-n Rayleigh--Schrodinger energy through O(1);
- level-spacing and anharmonicity expansions;
- endpoint cancellation/enhancement after full pullback.

Conjectural:
- finite physical canonical domain chain;
- sectorial continuation coefficient C_ess;
- reduction of physical quantization to C_ess=0;
- equivalence and local factorization with Delta_WI;
- O(u^-1) relative Weber connection remainder.

Open:
- rigorous remainder for the operator asymptotic;
- global progressive paths and connection theorem;
- complete eta^(-2/3) energy coefficient;
- growing-n uniformity.

